Private email with end-to-end encryption
Aster Mail is the desktop app for Aster, a private email service. Your mail is encrypted on your device before it is sent.
Mail between two Aster accounts is also protected with quantum-safe encryption.
The apps are open source under the AGPL-3.0 license.

You need an Aster account to use it. You can sign up for free in the app or at https://astermail.org

To run: open Aster Mail from your app menu
To run in a terminal: aster-mail-desktop
